cff-version: 1.2.0
title: AuraDE
version: 0.1.0-prealpha
type: software
abstract: >-
  AuraDE is an unofficial ChromiumOS Ash-based desktop environment for Arch
  Linux, with a configurable local-first ChromeOS-style desktop, Wayland and
  X11 support, hardware integration, recovery tooling, and optional local AI.
date-released: 2026-08-10
repository-code: https://github.com/Cam396/aurade
url: https://github.com/Cam396/aurade
license: BSD-3-Clause
keywords:
  - AuraDE
  - ChromiumOS
  - ChromeOS
  - Ash
  - Arch Linux
  - Linux desktop environment
  - Wayland
  - Weston
  - local AI
  - accessibility
authors:
  - name: AuraDE Contributors
message: >-
  If you use AuraDE in research or a public project, cite the repository and
  the exact commit or release artifact used.
